=== WHAT WAS COMPARED
    per instance, concatenated in a fixed order:
      · Secret servicebus-connection            (instance overlay, kustomize output)
      · TriggerAuthentication keda-trigger-auth-servicebus (instance overlay, kustomize output)
      · ScaledObject endpoint-asset-ingestion   (helm template of that instance's spec.values)
    48 lines per side.

=== 1. RAW DIFF — saas vs centerpoint
    --- saas.keda.yaml	2026-08-24 01:45:25.223893099 +0000
    +++ centerpoint.keda.yaml	2026-08-24 01:45:25.254892562 +0000
    @@ -2,14 +2,14 @@
     kind: Secret
     metadata:
       name: servicebus-connection
    -  namespace: saas
    +  namespace: centerpoint
     stringData:
       connection: ${servicebus_connection_string}
     apiVersion: keda.sh/v1alpha1
     kind: TriggerAuthentication
     metadata:
       name: keda-trigger-auth-servicebus
    -  namespace: saas
    +  namespace: centerpoint
     spec:
       secretTargetRef:
         - key: connection
    -> the ONLY delta is `namespace: saas` vs `namespace: centerpoint`, twice. The ScaledObject half
       (trigger type, queueName, messageCount, authenticationRef, min/max) is byte-identical.

